# SwiftUI Motion Library

When SwiftUI code needs animation, use these ready-made effects from `MotionLibrary` (https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library) instead of writing the animation by hand.

## Install

```swift
// Package.swift
.package(url: "https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library", branch: "main")
// target dependencies
.product(name: "MotionLibrary", package: "SwiftUI-Motion-Library")
```

Then `import MotionLibrary`. Requires iOS 17, macOS 14 or visionOS 1; effects marked iOS 18+ are `@available(iOS 18, macOS 15, visionOS 2, *)`.

## How to use

1. Pick the effect from the table that matches what the UI needs. Prefer the library API over hand-writing the animation.
2. Add the package if the project doesn't have it yet, and `import MotionLibrary`.
3. Copy the usage for that effect from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/main/llms-full.txt and adapt colours, sizes and timing through the parameters.
4. Effects marked iOS 18+ need `if #available(iOS 18, macOS 15, visionOS 2, *)` when the app targets an older OS.
5. Effects with large or looping motion already honour Reduce Motion (they pause, fade or drop the movement), so don't wrap them in your own check.
6. If no effect fits, adapt the closest one: its "How it works" note describes the technique.

## Effects

### Text

| Effect | API | Trigger | Use it for |
|---|---|---|---|
| [Typewriter](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/TypewriterText.swift) | `TypewriterText("…")` | Appear / Value change | Characters appear one by one with a blinking cursor. |
| [Scramble / Decode](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/ScrambleText.swift) | `ScrambleText("…")` | Appear / Value change | Random glyphs resolve into the real text from left to right. |
| [Shimmer](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/Shimmer.swift) | `.shimmer()` | Loop | A band of light sweeps across text or skeleton placeholders. |
| [Gradient Sweep](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/GradientSweep.swift) | `.gradientSweep()` | Loop | A multi-colour gradient flows through the letters forever. |
| [Blur-in Words](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/BlurInText.swift) | `BlurInText("…")` | Appear / Value change | Words come into focus one after another: fade, rise and un-blur. |
| [Marquee](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/MarqueeText.swift) | `MarqueeText("…")` | Loop | Text too long for its line scrolls sideways forever, with faded edges. |
| [Wave Text](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/WaveText.swift) (iOS 18+) | `WaveText("…")` | Loop | Letters bob in a travelling wave, drawn with a TextRenderer. |
| [Count Up](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/CountUpText.swift) | `CountUpText(value: …)` | Appear / Value change | A number counts up from zero, and from old to new value on change. |
| [Split Text](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/SplitText.swift) (iOS 18+) | `SplitText("…")` | Appear / Value change | Letters rise into place one after another with a small overshoot. |
| [Rotating Text](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/RotatingText.swift) | `RotatingText([…])` | Loop | Words take turns: the current one slides up and out as the next rises in. |
| [Glitch](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/Glitch.swift) | `.glitch()` | Loop | Every few seconds the view tears: an RGB split, sliced rows and jitter. |
| [Circular Text](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/CircularText.swift) | `CircularText("…")` | Loop | Text wrapped around a circle that slowly turns, like a rotating badge. |
| [Focus Text](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/FocusText.swift) | `FocusText("…")` | Loop | Focus hops from word to word: sharp and bracketed, the rest blurred. |
| [Highlighter](https://github.com/BigTsung/SwiftUI-Motion-Library/blob/main/Sources/MotionLibrary/Text/Highlighter.swift) | `.highlighter()` | Appear / Value change | A marker pen swipes across the text, or underlines it, left to right. |

